<title>USA: SmartServ Online Inc Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>SmartServ Online Inc Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996	     1995</p>
<p> Revenues				     $13,852		 N/A</p>
<p> Loss from operations		     833,163	   341,204</p>
<p> Interest expense (income) - net     (37,326)	    51,935</p>
<p> Net loss				     795,837	   393,139</p>
<p> Loss per share				   .22		 .20</p>
<p>Average number of shares outstanding</p>
<p>						3,695,000	 1,926,650</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said revenue results for the 1995 period were not available as they were in their developmental stage during that period and not generating revenues.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
